    "splashTitle": "Aaseya Inspection Solution Connector (OutSystems)",
    "splashDescription": "Automatically initiate inspection cases in OutSystems from Camunda-orchestrated business processes. This connector integrates Camunda with OutSystems for real-time data exchange, efficient case management, and streamlined business operations. Features include error handling, retry mechanisms, and secure API communication for reliable performance. This connect is suitable for organizations seeking seamless collaboration between process orchestration and case management.",
